flowchart TD
    Query[User question]
    Cache{FAISS semantic cache hit?}
    Cached[Return cached model response]
    Router[LM Studio complexity classifier]
    Route{SIMPLE or COMPLEX}
    ChatModel[Configured LM Studio chat model]
    Prompt[Snowflake SQL prompt]
    Generated[Generated SQL text]
    Cost[Synthetic token-cost ledger]
    Store[Embed question and store response in FAISS]

    Query --> Cache
    Cache -->|Yes| Cached
    Cache -->|No| Router
    Router --> Route
    Route --> ChatModel
    Query --> Prompt
    Prompt --> ChatModel
    ChatModel --> Generated
    Generated --> Cost
    Generated --> Store
    Query --> Store

    Embeddings[LM Studio Nomic embedding model]
    Embeddings --> Cache
    Embeddings --> Store

    note1[Current code generates SQL only; it does not connect to or query a database]
    note1 -.-> Generated
